ts=2026-08-18T00:00:00Z actor=opencode event=roadmap_created roadmap=cloudmappr status=active summary="Isomorphic world-map baseline planned" notes="Cloudmappr is a standalone project. The active baseline is an MJS D3/TopoJSON world map with five static shards, shared MapSpec/scene construction, Deno canonical SVG/PNG rendering, GitHub/esm.sh delivery, and client export/share support. Pre-rendered SVG land is deferred pending proof."
ts=2026-08-18T00:00:00Z actor=opencode event=roadmap_update roadmap=cloudmappr status=active summary="Generic map-contract migration checklist linked" notes="Added Cloudmappr memory identifying remaining reusable Custom Element, presentation/accessibility, source provenance, label, and deferred SVG-fragment requirements to migrate from prior map research while excluding Corfeed-specific application and actor concerns."
ts=2026-08-18T00:00:00Z actor=opencode event=roadmap_update roadmap=cloudmappr status=active summary="Generic map-contract migration completed" notes="Created and routed governing contracts for the optional Custom Element, presentation/accessibility, artifact provenance, and label behavior. Retained the SVG-fragment proposal as a deferred experiment with receiver and export proof gates."
ts=2026-08-18T00:00:00Z actor=opencode event=ledger_routing_added roadmap=cloudmappr status=active summary="Tiered agent routing and grep-first discovery added" notes="Added AGENTS.md, control.yaml, ledger.yaml, and discovery guidance. Agents now orient through T0-T3 routing, select roadmap sections through grepable hooks, and use Glob/Grep before source reads."
ts=2026-08-18T00:00:00Z actor=opencode event=runtime_baseline_added roadmap=cloudmappr status=active summary="Deno bootstrap and functional baseline recorded" notes="Added root mise.toml with latest Deno and recorded the pure-core, typed-failure, functional lint, and colocated atomic/seam/live test strategy. Candidate npm packages were checked before later workspace adoption."
ts=2026-08-18T00:00:00Z actor=opencode event=functional_tooling_implemented roadmap=cloudmappr status=active summary="Deno functional core tooling verified" notes="Added Deno tasks, pinned functional and ESLint dependencies, core functional primitives, and colocated atomic/seam/live test files. mise run verify passed Deno lint, ESLint, type checking, and four non-live tests; mise run test-live passed the explicit live convention."
ts=2026-08-18T00:00:00Z actor=opencode event=svelte_dependency_added roadmap=cloudmappr status=active summary="Standalone Svelte consumer dependency added" notes="Installed svelte 5.56.9 without SvelteKit and routed the wrapper boundary: map behavior remains in the framework-neutral MJS controller; a future Svelte component only owns lifecycle and prop/event translation."
ts=2026-08-18T00:00:00Z actor=codex event=pages_local_delivery_planned roadmap=cloudmappr status=active summary="Local GitHub Pages build and branch publication routed" notes="Added a ready strategy for locally building, previewing, and publishing static Pages output through a dedicated gh-pages branch without a repository GitHub Actions workflow. The MJS controller, manifest, data-artifact, CDN, esm.sh, and release pipeline remain intentionally undecided."
ts=2026-08-18T00:00:00Z actor=codex event=esm_selected_shard_delivery_routed roadmap=cloudmappr status=active summary="esm.sh module and selected-shard delivery strategy expanded" notes="Linked a dedicated roadmap decision to the GitHub/esm.sh delivery card. The card now defines explicit per-shard entry points, immutable release identity, candidate MJS-wrapper versus separate-TopoJSON transport, esm.sh transform policy, and external browser/Deno network proof gates."
ts=2026-08-18T00:00:00Z actor=codex event=eight_shard_policy_adopted roadmap=cloudmappr status=active summary="World delivery policy expanded from five to eight shards" notes="The baseline now uses eager world-basemap plus lazy north-america, south-america, europe, africa, asia, oceania-major, and antarctica TopoJSON artifacts. Atomic-part assignment is versioned and reviewed; the change targets map delivery and bounded render geometry, while broader server-rendering optimization remains future work."
ts=2026-08-18T00:00:00Z actor=codex event=world_generation_toolchain_planned roadmap=cloudmappr status=active summary="Pinned Mapshaper and typed generator boundary recorded" notes="Installed mapshaper 0.7.53 as a development dependency and linked a build-toolchain strategy. The Deno TypeScript generator owns typed eight-shard assignment, validation, manifest, and provenance logic; Mapshaper is a build-only adapter. Every build component requires a narrow contract, and pure primitives remain isolated from filesystem, process, network, and CLI effects."
